- `.checkbox` (20px) / `.checkbox-2` (24px outlined), `.radio` (dot) / `.radio-2` (diamond rotated 45°); checked via `.on` / `:checked` / `[aria-checked="true"]`; disable with `.disabled` or `[disabled]`.
